{"5315870":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Saucer Slam","steam_appid":5315870,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<strong>Saucer Slam<\/strong> brings back the fun of everyone crammed onto one couch, controllers getting passed around, somebody yelling after getting knocked off the arena again. Grab up to 4 players, add as many bots as you like, and pick from nine ways to fight it out across 39 handcrafted arenas, knocking rivals off a floating platform before they do it to you.<br><br>No online, no matchmaking, no accounts. Just your friends, your couch, and chaos.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>1-4 players, local only: built for one screen, with up to 8 saucers in the ring when you add bots<br><\/li><li>9 game modes: Free-For-All, Team Battle, One vs All, Lives, Random, Gauntlet, Football, King of the Hill, and Race<br><\/li><li>39 arenas across multiple themes, including dedicated football pitches and race tracks<br><\/li><li>Play solo or with a small group: add as many AI bots as you like in every mode, not just Gauntlet, which is built specifically around escalating AI waves<br><\/li><li>Deep customization: dozens of hull colors, 29 hats, trail effects, and boost sounds per player<br><\/li><li>10 achievements with progressive unlocks that reward playtime with new cosmetics<br><\/li><li>Full controller support for every player (Xbox, PlayStation, Switch Pro and other gamepads), and up to 4 players can share one keyboard<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Free-For-All<\/strong>: every saucer for itself, last one standing wins the round<br><\/li><li><strong>Team Battle<\/strong>: split the roster in half and fight it out<br><\/li><li><strong>One vs All<\/strong>: one Hunted saucer against everyone else<br><\/li><li><strong>Lives<\/strong>: limited lives, last one with lives left wins the match<br><\/li><li><strong>Random<\/strong>: a fresh mode every round, one shared scoreboard<br><\/li><li><strong>Gauntlet<\/strong>: solo or co-op against waves of increasingly tough AI<br><\/li><li><strong>Football<\/strong>: push the ball into the opposing goal, first to 5 wins<br><\/li><li><strong>King of the Hill<\/strong>: hold the zone the longest before time runs out<br><\/li><li><strong>Race<\/strong>: no combat, just checkpoints and lap times<\/li><\/ul><br>Whether it's a full couch of friends, a couple of you against a room full of bots, or a solo run through Gauntlet, Saucer Slam is built for quick, chaotic rounds you can jump in and out of in seconds.<br><br><i>This game contains flashing lights and rapid visual effects that may not be suitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy.<\/i>","about_the_game":"<strong>Saucer Slam<\/strong> brings back the fun of everyone crammed onto one couch, controllers getting passed around, somebody yelling after getting knocked off the arena again. Grab up to 4 players, add as many bots as you like, and pick from nine ways to fight it out across 39 handcrafted arenas, knocking rivals off a floating platform before they do it to you.<br><br>No online, no matchmaking, no accounts. Just your friends, your couch, and chaos.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>1-4 players, local only: built for one screen, with up to 8 saucers in the ring when you add bots<br><\/li><li>9 game modes: Free-For-All, Team Battle, One vs All, Lives, Random, Gauntlet, Football, King of the Hill, and Race<br><\/li><li>39 arenas across multiple themes, including dedicated football pitches and race tracks<br><\/li><li>Play solo or with a small group: add as many AI bots as you like in every mode, not just Gauntlet, which is built specifically around escalating AI waves<br><\/li><li>Deep customization: dozens of hull colors, 29 hats, trail effects, and boost sounds per player<br><\/li><li>10 achievements with progressive unlocks that reward playtime with new cosmetics<br><\/li><li>Full controller support for every player (Xbox, PlayStation, Switch Pro and other gamepads), and up to 4 players can share one keyboard<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Free-For-All<\/strong>: every saucer for itself, last one standing wins the round<br><\/li><li><strong>Team Battle<\/strong>: split the roster in half and fight it out<br><\/li><li><strong>One vs All<\/strong>: one Hunted saucer against everyone else<br><\/li><li><strong>Lives<\/strong>: limited lives, last one with lives left wins the match<br><\/li><li><strong>Random<\/strong>: a fresh mode every round, one shared scoreboard<br><\/li><li><strong>Gauntlet<\/strong>: solo or co-op against waves of increasingly tough AI<br><\/li><li><strong>Football<\/strong>: push the ball into the opposing goal, first to 5 wins<br><\/li><li><strong>King of the Hill<\/strong>: hold the zone the longest before time runs out<br><\/li><li><strong>Race<\/strong>: no combat, just checkpoints and lap times<\/li><\/ul><br>Whether it's a full couch of friends, a couple of you against a room full of bots, or a solo run through Gauntlet, Saucer Slam is built for quick, chaotic rounds you can jump in and out of in seconds.<br><br><i>This game contains flashing lights and rapid visual effects that may not be suitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy.<\/i>","short_description":"Local multiplayer sumo mayhem for 1-4 players, with as many bots as you like. Knock, boost, and blast rival saucers off the arena across 39 maps and 9 modes: Free-For-All, Team Battle, Football, King of the Hill, co-op Gauntlet, and more. Grab some controllers and go.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5315870\/c1ef4fd2e8470d7977df7c87413be8c72a01e7c0\/header.jpg?t=1793734690","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5315870\/fffc0b49d3473cf7721f46f9887c71da141dde3a\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793734690","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5315870\/fffc0b49d3473cf7721f46f9887c71da141dde3a\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793734690","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core 2.5 GHz or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Vulkan 1.1–capable GPU, 1 GB VRAM (e.g. Intel UHD 620, NVIDIA GTX 750 or better)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> 1-4 players. Controllers: Xbox, PlayStation, Switch Pro and generic gamepads, one per player. Keyboard also supported (up to 4 players on one keyboard).<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad-core 3.0 GHz or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GTX 1050 \/ RX 560 or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"legal_notice":"© 2026 Saucer Slam. All rights reserved. Made with Godot Engine — see in-game Credits.","developers":["Rokko Games"],"publishers":["Rokko Games"],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":169,"final":169,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"1,69€"},"pac